   "source": [
    "## 3. Cleaning Data\n",
    "\n",
    "Berdasarkan hasil assessing tadi, kita temukan beberapa masalah:\n",
    "1. **Missing Value:** Kolom tanggal di `orders` banyak yang kosong (approved, delivered).\n",
    "2. **Duplicate:** `geolocation` punya banyak baris dobel.\n",
    "3. **Inconsistent:** Nama kota ditulis campur aduk (uppercase/lowercase).\n",
    "4. **Outlier:** Ada harga barang & ongkir yang sangat ekstrem.\n",
    "\n",
    "Solusi cleaning:\n",
    "- Ubah semua kolom tanggal jadi tipe datetime.\n",
    "- Standardisasi nama kota jadi lowercase.\n",
    "- Drop duplikasi di geolocation.\n",
    "- Handle missing value dengan drop baris yang statusnya 'delivered' tapi tanggal sampai kosong, atau fill dengan estimated.\n",
    "- Untuk outlier, kita biarkan dulu tapi kita aware saat agregasi (karena outlier bisa jadi transaksi legitimate besar)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "id": "e6287fef",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Geolocation: 261831 baris duplikat dihapus. Sisa: 738332\n",
      "Dropped 8 'delivered' orders tanpa tanggal sampai.\n",
      "Orders shape sebelum: (99441, 8) -> sesudah: (99433, 8)\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# 1. Konversi datetime\n",
    "date_cols = ['order_purchase_timestamp','order_approved_at','order_delivered_carrier_date',\n",
    "             'order_delivered_customer_date','order_estimated_delivery_date']\n",
    "for c in date_cols:\n",
    "    orders[c] = pd.to_datetime(orders[c], errors='coerce')\n",
    "\n",
    "items['shipping_limit_date'] = pd.to_datetime(items['shipping_limit_date'], errors='coerce')\n",
    "reviews['review_creation_date'] = pd.to_datetime(reviews['review_creation_date'], errors='coerce')\n",
    "reviews['review_answer_timestamp'] = pd.to_datetime(reviews['review_answer_timestamp'], errors='coerce')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 2. Standardisasi nama kota (customers & sellers)\n",
    "customers['customer_city'] = customers['customer_city'].str.lower().str.strip()\n",
    "sellers['seller_city'] = sellers['seller_city'].str.lower().str.strip()\n",
    "\n",
    "# 3. Drop duplikasi geolocation\n",
    "geo_before = len(geolocation)\n",
    "geolocation = geolocation.drop_duplicates()\n",
    "geo_after = len(geolocation)\n",
    "print(f\"Geolocation: {geo_before - geo_after} baris duplikat dihapus. Sisa: {geo_after}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 4. Handle missing value pada orders\n",
    "mask_delivered = (orders['order_status'] == 'delivered') & (orders['order_delivered_customer_date'].isnull())\n",
    "dropped = mask_delivered.sum()\n",
    "orders_clean = orders[~mask_delivered].copy()\n",
    "print(f\"Dropped {dropped} 'delivered' orders tanpa tanggal sampai.\")\n",
    "print(f\"Orders shape sebelum: {orders.shape} -> sesudah: {orders_clean.shape}\")"
   ]
  },
